{"sha":"47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab","node_id":"C_kwDOSCAVVtoAKDQ3MjQ4YjU3NzA0NmIwNTYzZTU3ZTc4ZWRhZDg2YTMxMDZjNmZhYWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"poseljacob","email":"110408753+poseljacob@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-04-14T20:09:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"poseljacob","email":"110408753+poseljacob@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-04-14T20:09:42Z"},"message":"Policy: don't edit backend source during a running pipeline\n\nuvicorn --reload wipes the in-memory JobRegistry and ProjectStore on\nevery watched-file change. Document the gotcha so future sessions don't\nlose in-flight jobs by editing src/ mid-run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41a394acd1559b02915895d233ca643fbeabb265","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/git/trees/41a394acd1559b02915895d233ca643fbeabb265"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/git/commits/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/commits/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab","html_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/commit/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/commits/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab/comments","author":{"login":"poseljacob","id":110408753,"node_id":"U_kgDOBpS0MQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110408753?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob","html_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"poseljacob","id":110408753,"node_id":"U_kgDOBpS0MQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110408753?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob","html_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poseljacob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c4348453e4dae15f4e6a48eeb1bc92cd35d6e780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/commits/c4348453e4dae15f4e6a48eeb1bc92cd35d6e780","html_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/commit/c4348453e4dae15f4e6a48eeb1bc92cd35d6e780"}],"stats":{"total":22,"additions":22,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"02b2d1c2d3488504dde957a592ee091d3db7080a","filename":".claude/policies/uvicorn-reload-wipes-state.md","status":"added","additions":22,"deletions":0,"changes":22,"blob_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/blob/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab/.claude%2Fpolicies%2Fuvicorn-reload-wipes-state.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/raw/47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab/.claude%2Fpolicies%2Fuvicorn-reload-wipes-state.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poseljacob/agentic-video-editor/contents/.claude%2Fpolicies%2Fuvicorn-reload-wipes-state.md?ref=47248b577046b0563e57e78edad86a3106c6faab","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@\n+---\n+id: uvicorn-reload-wipes-state\n+title: uvicorn --reload wipes in-memory registries mid-run\n+scope: repo\n+trigger: editing backend source while a pipeline is running\n+enforcement: soft\n+---\n+\n+## Rule\n+\n+Do NOT edit files under `src/` (especially `src/web/`, `src/pipeline/`, `src/agents/`) while a pipeline job is running against `uvicorn --reload`. The file-watcher restarts the process, which wipes `JobRegistry`, `ProjectStore`, and any other in-memory state. You will lose all in-flight jobs and have to re-create projects from scratch.\n+\n+If you need to modify backend code mid-session:\n+1. Let the current job finish (or cancel it)\n+2. Make the edit\n+3. Recreate the project and restart the pipeline\n+\n+For tests that cross the reload boundary, run `uvicorn` without `--reload` and restart manually.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+`JobRegistry` and `ProjectStore` are populated at FastAPI `lifespan` startup and held only in `app.state`. `--reload` triggers a full process restart on any `.py` change under the watched dirs, dropping all state. This bit the developer during open-source-prep: a runner.py edit mid-pipeline killed the active Demo Project and its in-flight reviewer retry loop, forcing a full re-run."}]}